# This working folder also holds local clones of mentee repositories,
# so everything is ignored by default and the toolkit is allowlisted back in.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!package.json
!LICENSE
!.claude/
!.claude/**
!example/
!example/**

# Real mentee reviews and the PR registry stay local — they contain
# student names, handles, and per-student findings.
.claude/reviews/

# Generated rubrics are per-user output, not toolkit content — see
# example/template.md for what one looks like.
.claude/templates/

# Per-machine settings and agent memory are not shared.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/agent-memory/
